    <h2>Start with your decision</h2>
    <p>Email a short description of the company stage, financing decision and deadline, or book a short conversation. Please leave confidential documents out of the first message.</p>
    <p><a href="mailto:gennady@menadd.com?subject=Financing%20Terms%20Review">Request the scope, fee and delivery date</a></p>
    <p><a href="mailto:gennady@menadd.com">gennady@menadd.com</a></p>
    <div class="assessment-cta-group">
      <a class="button-link" href="https://calendar.app.google/NHdtM4bGDWJgMDi16">Book a financing conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Further reading</h2>
    <p><a href="/library/ownership/how-founders-lose-a-company-in-three-years/">How Founders Lose a Company in Three Years</a></p>
